sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Member in their browser
  participant P as Privy
  participant API as Truway API
  participant RPC as Stellar RPC
  M->>API: Approve
  API->>RPC: simulateTransaction(approve)
  RPC-->>API: Member's authorisation entry
  API->>API: Sets nonce and expiry of about 720 ledgers
  API-->>M: Hash to sign
  M->>P: signRawHash
  P-->>M: Signature
  M->>API: Signature
  API->>API: Checks the signature against the member's address
  API->>RPC: Simulates again and submits
  Note over API,RPC: Truway is the source and pays the fee
  RPC-->>API: Confirmed
  API-->>M: Registered · verifiable
